    "chunk_text": "Nu syndon ehte heafodlehtres \u00fee us onwinne\u00f0 swy\u00f0e. An is gecwe\u00f0en gula, \u00fe\u00e6t is gifernysse on \u00e6nglisc. Seo de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t mann ett \u00e6rtime & drinc\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0e he eft to mycel nym\u00f0 on \u00e6te o\u00f0\u00f0e on wiste, seo forde\u00f0 He forde\u00f0 eac \u00fea sawle, for \u00fean \u00fee he sceal synegian oft, \u00feone he sylf nat hwu he f\u00e6r\u00f0 for his Se o\u00f0er lehter is forleger, & ungemetegod galnysse. Se is gehaten fornicatio, & he befyl\u00f0 \u00feone mann, & maca\u00f0 of Cristes lymen myltestrena lymen, & of Se \u00feridde is auaritia, \u00fe\u00e6t is seo yfele gitsung, & seo is wyrttrume \u00e6lcere wohnysse, heo maca\u00f0 reaflac Se feor\u00f0e lehter is ira, \u00fe\u00e6t is on \u00e6nglisc weamodnysse, se de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se mann nah his modes geweald, ac Se fifte is tristicia, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feysser wurlde unrotnysse, \u00feone se mann geunrotso\u00f0 ealles to swy\u00f0e for his Twa unrotnysse synd, an is \u00feeos yfele, & o\u00f0er is halwende, \u00fe\u00e6t man for his synnen geunrotsige. Se sixte lehter is accidia gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6t is asolcannysse o\u00f0\u00f0e sl\u00e6w\u00f0e on \u00e6nglisc, \u00feonne \u00fean m\u00e6nn ne Se seofo\u00f0e lehter is jactantia, \u00fe\u00e6t is idelgelp on Engliscre sp\u00e6ce, \u00feonne se mann by\u00f0 lofgeorn & mid Se ehte\u00f0e lehter is superbia gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6t is on Englisc modignysse gecweden. Seo is ord &",
